 ## Contributing
 
-Issues and pull requests are accepted at [https://github.com/Z4nzu/hackingtool](https://github.com/Z4nzu/hackingtool). To add a tool, create a `HackingTool` subclass in the appropriate `tools/` module, define its `TITLE`, `DESCRIPTION`, and `PROJECT_URL`, add install and run commands, and register it in the category's `TOOLS` list.
